  "type": "module",
  "description": "client-ai-bridge (street567): Clipment mac side (clipment/cliprev CLI + MCP) + Agent Kanban (hooks, monitor, board MCP, kanban CLI) — Claude Code plugin / Codex",
  "bin": {
    "clipment": "./src/cli.ts",
